; Run 3 on OPS-SAT PRETTY (exp4051), version 2, segment 2: fixed TMR with
; each replica in a process of its own, on the same faults:
;   cycle  60  one bit flip in replica 2's computation (FaultInjector)
;   cycle 120  replica 1 returns the same wrong value (FaultInjector):
;              outvoted on every cycle; fixed TMR does not diagnose it
;   cycle 240  replica 0's process is killed with SIGKILL (by the manager
;              process): lost; fixed TMR compares replicas 1 and 2, which
;              disagree on every cycle, and delivers nothing more
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.manager.SET_POLICY TMR
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.injector.SET_UPSETS 0.0 0.05 1
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.injector.INJECT CORRUPT 2 60
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.injector.INJECT STUCK 1 120
